{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The Wanton Merchant: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja3'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 3 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Apaṇṇakavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Sure Bet </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>3. Serivavāṇijajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Wanton Merchant: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Idha ce naṁ virādhesi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>If you fail to achieve </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>saddhammassa niyāmataṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>certainty regarding the true teaching </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ciraṁ tvaṁ anutappesi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>you’ll regret it for a long time, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>serivāyaṁva vāṇijo”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>like this wanton merchant. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Serivavāṇijajātakaṁ tatiyaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
